  "sourceQuote": "$\\triangle ABH \\sim \\triangle CBA$이므로 $x = \\angle ACB$이고 $$\\sin x = \\sin \\angle ACB = \\dfrac{\\overline{AB}}{\\overline{BC}} = \\dfrac{5}{13}$$ $\\triangle ACH \\sim \\triangle BCA$이므로 $y = \\angle ABC$이고 $$\\tan y = \\tan \\angle ABC = \\dfrac{\\overline{AC}}{\\overline{AB}} = \\dfrac{12}{5}$$ 따라서 $$\\sin x \\times \\tan y = \\dfrac{5}{13} \\times \\dfrac{12}{5} = \\dfrac{12}{13}$$ 따라서 정답은 ⑤이다."
